        "original_id": "d5da11bd-f94e-5035-9ad0-682fc07e859d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Battle of the Ch'ongch'on River, Battle of Tarawa\n- Wars: Korean War, World War II\n- Places: Ch'ongch'on River Valley, northwestern North Korea, Tarawa, Pacific Theater\n\nFacts:\n- The Battle of Tarawa was fought in the Pacific Theater of World War II from 20 to 23 November 1943.\n- The Battle of the Ch'ongch'on River was a decisive battle in the Korean War that took place from 25 November to 2 December 1950.\n- The Battle of the Ch'ongch'on River was also known as the Battle of the Ch'ongch'on and the Second Phase Campaign Western Sector.\n- The Battle of the Ch'ongch'on River was fought along the Ch'ongch'on River Valley in the northwestern part of North Korea.",
